{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばちは\n \n 毎日録画した映画を見ようと意気込むのに、\n 気づいたらお布団でスヤスヤしてるんですよね。\n \n お布団の力って侮れません。\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n 先日京都での個別握手会のこと！\n \n 🐡1・2部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WQZNTVB68J50J55ZXHAT6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 🐡4・5部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR0QZE3CSDP87ZESCKHQ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 一回もきたことがなかった\n ワンピースを解禁しました✊\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR1T1Q70CBBA7WA9295MB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n お花と一緒に置いてあった\n 花冠を被りました〜👃\n \n ありがとうございました！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR2TX37KXP9A4VHC0XPQ0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR3VHEQ4NFG62EBSS5382","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR4V71V9242VH7SQPH3HE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR5VNCXJGB86EZCG0W1K6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR6VYDRGAQ07H2EV5EPDH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR7Z1ZQDFATWGD4FE0RM4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WR912TYRPS7ENX0RQ6YT1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WRA3ZB900T83FVCQ5G2RV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WRB5XPR907KMA11TPHP5T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 本っ当に素敵なお花をいつもいつも\n ありがとうございます💞\n \n \n \n \n \n お礼が遅くなってしまったのですが、\n けやき坂46のデビューアルバム「走り出す瞬間」が\n オリコン週間アルバムランキングで\n 第1位を記録致しました、、、！\n \n 本当に言葉じゃ表しきれない感謝と\n 嬉しさを感じています。\n \n 本当に本当にありがとうございます！！\n \n \n これから先もずっと\n 愛される「走り出す瞬間」であってほしいなと思います☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n お知らせです📢\n \n 6月30日発売の\n 「BUBKA」さんに載せていただいてます！\n 表紙も担当させていただきました、！\n \n 屋上での撮影、とても大好きな雰囲気でした👼\n 是非見てみてください！\n \n \n ばうちゃんの似顔絵も描いたよ😃\n \n \n \n \n そういえば、\n この間の握手会でひさびさにかげに会いました〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WRC7Q7ZAP5QZ9WDECXXNE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 元気そうでほっとしました🥛\n \n ちゃんともりもりご飯を食べて\n しっかり睡眠をとって\n 頑張ってほしいなと思っています。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 明日はついに東名阪ツアー地方公演ラストの！\n 名古屋です！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1WRDAXXFAKCN8YNGG1T78D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n たくさん跳びましょう🕴\n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}